  "kind": "lesson",
  "title": {
    "zh": "化学方程式配平",
    "en": "Balancing Chemical Equations"
  },
  "desc": {
    "zh": "化学反应不会凭空多出或消失原子，所以方程式两边每种原子数必须相等——配平就是调系数，把每杆小天平都调平。",
    "en": "Reactions never create or destroy atoms, so every element must have equal counts on both sides — balancing means adjusting coefficients until every little scale is level."
  },
